        "summary": {
          "zh": "<p>本課程介紹常用的資料結構與其分析方法，著重於實作與效能比較。</p><ul><li>陣列、串列、堆疊與佇列</li><li>樹、平衡樹與堆積</li><li>圖與最短路徑</li></ul><p>教科書：<em>Data Structures and Algorithms in C++</em>，作業與講義皆在 Moodle 公告。</p>",
          "en": "<p>An introduction to the common data structures and how to analyse them, with an emphasis on implementation and measuring performance.</p><ul><li>Arrays, lists, stacks and queues</li><li>Trees, balanced trees and heaps</li><li>Graphs and shortest paths</li></ul><p>Textbook: <em>Data Structures and Algorithms in C++</em>. Homework and slides are posted on Moodle.</p>"
        },
